OL,3,GNEWSAFoster families offered funding to
OL,4,Aexpand homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FFoster families who would like to care
OL,7,Ffor more children but do not have the
OL,8,Fspace are now able to access funding to
OL,9,Fhelp them extend their homes.
OL,11,FBradford Children and Families Trust
OL,12,Fand Bradford Council have opened the
OL,13,Fsupport fund to create more bedroom
OL,14,Fspace for children in care in the
OL,15,Fdistrict.
OL,17,FThe money is also available to special
OL,18,Fguardians and adopters to help siblings
OL,19,Fto stay together, and to carers who
OL,20,Fwith adaptations to their homes could
OL,21,Fsupport children with disabilities.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
