OL,3,GNEWSAFoster families offered funding to
OL,4,Aexpand homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Sally Birch, the council's
OL,7,FExecutive Member for Children and
OL,8,FFamilies, said: "If we're asking people
OL,9,Fto step forward and care for children,
OL,10,Fwe must also look at how we can support
OL,11,Fthem to do that."
